WEBVTT

00:05:27.276 --> 00:05:31.396
And we do have potential solutions
other than seaweed

00:05:31.396 --> 00:05:33.196
to reduce methane emissions.

00:05:33.596 --> 00:05:36.276
We looked at additives to feed,
such as 3-NOPs,

00:05:36.316 --> 00:05:39.076
reduce emissions by about 30 percent.

00:05:39.396 --> 00:05:42.476
Even garlic and citrus extract

00:05:42.516 --> 00:05:45.516
can reduce methane burps
by over 20 percent

00:05:45.556 --> 00:05:49.156
without affecting
animal health and productivity.

00:05:50.876 --> 00:05:52.716
Now you may ask:

00:05:52.756 --> 00:05:56.436
Why not stop eating
beef and drinking milk?

00:05:56.436 --> 00:05:57.636
Audience member: Yeah!

00:05:57.636 --> 00:05:59.396
(Laughter)

00:05:59.436 --> 00:06:01.076
EK: That would be a good question.